<h1>Refund requested for order <%= @order_ref %></h1>
<p>We have received your refund request.</p>
<p><strong>Requested amount:</strong> <%= @refund_amount %></p>
<p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @refund_reason %></p>
<p>We will notify you once processing is completed.</p>
<p>Need help? <%= @support_email %></p>
